// Orlando Qiu
// Default character: a simple two-link arm (root -> upper_arm -> forearm)
// All limbs are capsules of radius 0.04. A capsule's total length is height + 2*radius,
// so a limb of length L uses height = L - 0.08 and its round ends meet exactly at the joints.
// Every joint sits at the start of its limb; geometry_transform moves the capsule (which
// trimesh builds centred on the origin along z) so it starts at the joint and extends along
// -y (legs, arms), +y (spine, head), +x (shoulders) or +z (feet).
